<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Katamansu</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1826</span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a> · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anglo-ashanti-wars">Anglo-Ashanti Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Katamansu was fought in 1826 near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/accra">Accra</a> between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashanti-empire">Ashanti</a> army and a coalition of coastal peoples supported by the British. The Ashanti were defeated, partly by the use of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/congreve-rocket">Congreve rockets</a>. The defeat weakened Ashanti control over the coast and the southern provinces.</p></div>
